                                    S03 backends, S02 as the everything-at-once Jakarta EE
                                    case, then T01 as the scanner test. S02 and S08 were an
                                    Optional Labs appendix until 2026-09-08; they are core
                                    route now, so that appendix is gone.
                                -->
